  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AX4-QA2-002" ;
  triage:title "Residual of AX4-QA-006: task_actor_name in task_ledger.rs still hardcodes the literal atm-daemon instead of atm_storage::DAEMON_ACTOR_NAME" ;
  triage:description "AX.4 QA-2 (quality-mgr ax4-qa-r2, PR #1194 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T10:24Z; arch-qa ARCH-002 and rust-qa-agent QA-013, confirmed by quality-mgr) at head 193821c92. Re-assessment of AX4-QA-006 (which stays open; this is the new record for the residual). Four of the five hand-rolled name functions in crates/atm/src/commands/task_ledger.rs were replaced with canonical as_str() calls on the atm-storage enums, but task_actor_name's TaskActor::Daemon arm still hardcodes atm-daemon instead of the canonical atm_storage::DAEMON_ACTOR_NAME constant that this same diff introduced and that atm-storage-rusqlite/src/task_store.rs:121,317 already consume. Fix: use DAEMON_ACTOR_NAME (or a TaskActor::as_str()/Display on the storage side) in task_ledger.rs." ;
